C1  Unit-Complete companion leaf (both absent classes non-units)
   E_non = [1, 2, 3, 5, 7]   |S| = 22/35 = 0.628571   union bound |S| > 1/2 ? True
   E_non = [1, 3, 4, 5, 7]   |S| = 5/14 = 0.357143   union bound |S| > 1/2 ? False
   E_non = [1, 3, 5, 6, 7]   |S| = 6/7 = 0.857143   union bound |S| > 1/2 ? True
   -> rho0 = 4 gives 5/14 < 1/2: the union-bound test CAN fail, so the
      18 dropped-unit passes are not forced by the code.

C2  all seven classes present
   E_non = [1..7]   |S| = 0   (expected 0)
   ne.safe_cells([1..7]) returns 0 safe cells (expected 0), so the
   witness locator has nothing to pick and the argument would report failure.
   Search over 5- and 6-element E_non found no empty S (see du2_controls log),
   so this control had to be built from the 7-class set.

